     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Income = $3,450</p>\n<p>Expenses <span data-math=\" = 925 + 178.54 + 129.49 + 117 + 195 + 290 + 21.99 + 49.99 + 400 = \\$ 2,307.01\"></span></p>\n<p>Budget <span data-math=\" = 3,450-2,307.01 = \\$ 1,142.99\"></span></p>\n<p>He has $1,142.99 after accounting for expenses.</p>"
